==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|aprender}}, from {{inh|pt|la|apprendere}}, alternative form of {{m|la|apprehendere}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|apprehendō}}. Compare the borrowed doublet {{doublet|pt|apreender|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA|aprendêr}}
* {{hyphenation|pt|a|pren|der}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb|aprend|er}}

# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[learn]], to acquire [[knowledge]]
#: {{ux|pt|Em dois anos, '''aprendi''' francês.|In two years, I '''learned''' French.}}
# {{lb|pt|intransitive}} to be able to [[learn]]
